The official open-source license for this project is currently under review and pending confirmation with community stakeholders, language experts, and project custodians.

Until a specific open-source license (such as MIT, Apache 2.0, or CC-BY-NC-SA) is formally adopted:
1. The code in this repository is made available for preliminary review, testing, and evaluation purposes.
2. Tangkhul cultural records, traditional songs, proverbs, oral literature, and historical texts catalogued in this project remain the intellectual and cultural heritage of the Tangkhul community.
3. Commercial redistribution or sub-licensing of community cultural assets is strictly prohibited prior to formal community licensing confirmation.

For licensing inquiries or community governance questions, please open an issue in the project issue tracker.
